[list]
[*]Fix: colonists build floor borders again. From v1.1.0 to v1.1.2 the borders' one-button-per-shape menu used a setting the game also reads as marking a building that only some ideoligions may build. In a game without Ideology no colonist would build one, and with Ideology some colonists refused as well, depending on their ideoligion's precepts. The blueprints placed and stayed unbuilt, and ordering a colonist to build one might report that only members of another ideoligion could. Every ideoligion can build them now.
[*]For mod authors: a border another mod adds to a shape's button is covered by the same fix.
[*]Unchanged: Neat Edges still requires only Harmony, no defs changed, and nothing new is saved. Hard edges, areas and borders already in your saves load as they are and harden the same edges.
[/list]
